<title>UK: Halifax shares to be sold in daily tender.</title>
<headline>Halifax shares to be sold in daily tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Halifax Plc said on Friday orders had been received to sell a total of 7.58 million shares at the daily tender, representing about 0.3 percent of the firm's share capital.</p>
<p>Halifax said bids would be accepted up to 1700 GMT from pre-registered institutions and London Stock Exchange member firms.</p>
<p>The mortgage lender made its stock market debut on Monday, ranking third among Britain's biggest listed banks. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
